us on our Discord! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Testers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some cases, we also test new features and mechanics exclusively with our Discord community. We value your feedback and encourage you to join us.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047310/extras/10e6095f88379115081ecc9bffab5ed8.poster.avif?t=1751969029\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047310/extras/10e6095f88379115081ecc9bffab5ed8.webm?t=1751969029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047310/extras/10e6095f88379115081ecc9bffab5ed8.mp4?t=1751969029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world of Aim Assault!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
